### =====================================================
### Authentication API Tests
### =====================================================
### Base URL: http://localhost:3000/api/v1
###
### Response Format (Login & Register):
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "data": {
###     "message": "Login/Registration successful",
###     "user": { id, email, name, role, ... },
###     "accessToken": "eyJhbG...",
###     "refreshToken": "eyJhbG...",
###     "expiresIn": 900
###   }
### }
### =====================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1

### -----------------------------------------------------
### LOGIN
### POST /api/v1/auth/login
### Returns user data with JWT tokens for API authentication
### -----------------------------------------------------

### Login with test user credentials
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
content-type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Pass@123"
}

### Login with seeded admin user
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
content-type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@dealsmart.ai",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

### Login with seeded creator user
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
content-type: application/json

{
  "email": "creator@example.com",
  "password": "Creator@123"
}

### Login - Invalid credentials (should return 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
content-type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "WrongPassword"
}

### Login - Validation error (should return 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
content-type: application/json

{
  "email": "invalid-email",
  "password": "123"
}


### -----------------------------------------------------
### REGISTER
### POST /api/v1/auth/register
### Creates new user and returns JWT tokens for immediate API access
### -----------------------------------------------------

### Register new user
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
content-type: application/json

{
  "email": "newuser@example.com",
  "password": "Pass@123",
  "name": "New User"
}

### Register - Email already exists (should return 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
content-type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@dealsmart.ai",
  "password": "Pass@123",
  "name": "Duplicate User"
}

### Register - Validation error (should return 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
content-type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "weak",
  "name": ""
}


### -----------------------------------------------------
### CURRENT USER
### GET /api/v1/users/me
### Requires authentication (NextAuth session or Bearer token)
### -----------------------------------------------------

### Get current user profile (requires auth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me


### -----------------------------------------------------
### UPDATE CURRENT USER
### PATCH /api/v1/users/me
### Requires authentication
### -----------------------------------------------------

### Update current user name
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me
content-type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Name"
}


### -----------------------------------------------------
### DELETE ACCOUNT (Self-Deletion)
### DELETE /api/v1/users/me
### Requires authentication and password confirmation
### This action is IRREVERSIBLE
### -----------------------------------------------------

### Delete own account (requires password confirmation)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/me
content-type: application/json

{
  "password": "Pass@123"
}

### Delete account - Wrong password (should return 401)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/me
content-type: application/json

{
  "password": "WrongPassword"
}

### Delete account - Missing password (should return 400)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/me
content-type: application/json

{}


### -----------------------------------------------------
### HEALTH CHECK
### GET /api/v1/health
### No authentication required
### -----------------------------------------------------

### Check API health and database connectivity
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
